AI: Netflix recommendations

What the AI does

Netflix suggests movies and shows based on viewer attention and behavior.

What data it uses

It uses your watch history, shows and movies you rate or interact with, your searches, and how you use the app.

What business problem it solves

Netflix benefits sponsors by keeping viewers interested and hooked, which can help reduce cancellation of plans.

Who benefits

Both the company and the people benefit off the AI. Viewers get something to watch and the company retains customers.

What could go wrong

Inaccurate recommendations, show the same content repeatedly, and collect more personal information that consumers are comfortable with.
